  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そういや、まだちゃんと礼を言ってなかったよな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_j:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "今更だが、オレと一緒にアイドルになってくれて……\nありがとな、玄武！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_j:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺にも礼を言わせてくれ。お前みたいな漢と\nアイドルやれて、誇りに思うぜ。朱雀！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_j:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……にゃー！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "にゃん喜威"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_j:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いてっ！　すまねえ、にゃこ。　\n起こして悪かったって。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_j:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おっと、朱雀。にゃこを捕まえておいてくれよ。\nこれ以上近寄られたら、くしゃみが止まらなくなる。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_j:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "わかってるって。\nほら、にゃこのベッドはこっちだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_j:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "さて、にゃこにうるさいって怒られちまったし、\n俺たちもそろそろ寝るか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_j:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "おう、そうだな。\n……明日はオレたち315プロが、トップバッターだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_j:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "オレたちで、会場の、業界の、\nいいや、世界中の度肝を抜いてやろうぜ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_09_j:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_09_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_09_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 24,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "言行一致。俺たち神速一魂なら、絶対にやれる！　\n最高にかましてやろうぜ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
